   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "Each village has its own, usually in summer. «Popular» ends in r: the stress is last.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "costumbre",
   "significado": "custom",
   "pron": "kos-TUM-bre",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "noun",
   "genero": "f",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is feminine: «una costumbre». A custom is something repeated over the years.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "disfraz",
   "significado": "costume",
   "pron": "dis-FRATH",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "noun",
   "genero": "m",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "The final z sounds th: dis-FRATH. The plural is «disfraces», with c.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "disfrazarse de",
   "significado": "to dress up as",
   "pron": "dis-fra-THAR-se de",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "verb",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It takes «de» and what you are: «me disfrazo de pirata». It comes from «disfraz».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "desfile",
   "significado": "parade",
   "pron": "des-FI-le",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "noun",
   "genero": "m",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is masculine: «un desfile». There are parades of floats, of fashion or of bands.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "carroza",
   "significado": "float",
   "pron": "ka-RRO-tha",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "noun",
   "genero": "f",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It moves slowly in a parade. The rr is strong: ka-RRO-tha.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "fuegos artificiales",
   "significado": "fireworks",
   "pron": "FWE-gos ar-ti-fi-THYA-les",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is always said in the plural: «unos fuegos artificiales». They are set off at night.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "verbena",
   "significado": "open-air night party",
   "pron": "ber-BE-na",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "noun",
   "genero": "f",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "The v sounds like b: ber-BE-na. It is held in the street or the square, mostly in summer.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "concurso",
   "significado": "contest",
   "pron": "kon-KUR-so",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "noun",
   "genero": "m",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "There are costume, cooking and dance contests. The stress is on «cur».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "boda",
   "significado": "wedding",
   "pron": "BO-da",
   "ipa": "",
